# Vendored third-party app builds live here, one folder per app (e.g.
# patient-browser/), each holding the app's static `dist/` output copied in by
# hand. They're gitignored — a fresh clone or CI won't have them — and are a
# stopgap until the cloud app store ships. Only this directory's docs are
# tracked; ignore everything else.
/*
!.gitignore
!README.md
